" Modal's default theme, darker (decided 25 November 2026): the dark theme taken darker, with the
" teal of Tokyo Night Terminal Dark for notes and bars. Each background shade moves down with the
" background and is brought back until it stands as far from it as in dark, keeping dark's
" contrasts. A theme is a command file of highlight lines, a colour for each role; set theme=NAME
" runs themes/NAME from the config directory, or a built-in theme, after starting again from this one.

